# These are IPs observed attacking SIP servers in real deployments —
# useful as a starting point, not an exhaustive or currently-accurate
# blocklist. Attacker infrastructure churns constantly; treat this as
# a seed list, not a subscription.
#
# To use: copy this file to lib/known-ips.txt (without .example) and
# adjust it with IPs relevant to your own logs/threat intel.
#
# One IP per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.

